<td class="border border-gray-200 px-4 py-2">Yes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border border-gray-200 px-4 py-2 font-semibold">Terra-Pro</td>
<td class="border border-gray-200 px-4 py-2">$1.00/M in &middot; $6.00/M out</td>
